FT                   /note="Domain:cl27725:EPSP_synthase EPSP synthase
FT                   (3-phosphoshikimate 1-carboxyvinyltransferase). This model
FT                   represents 3-phosphoshikimate-1-carboxyvinyltransferase
FT                   (aroA), which catalyzes the sixth of seven steps in the
FT                   shikimate pathway of the biosynthesis of chorimate.
FT                   Chorismate is last common precursor of all three aromatic
FT                   amino acids. Sequences scoring between the trusted and
