FT                   /note="Domain:cl25874:Dala_Dala_lig_N D-ala D-ala ligase
FT                   N-terminus. This model describes D-Ala--D-Ala ligase, an
FT                   enzyme that makes a required precursor of the bacterial
FT                   cell wall. It also describes some closely related proteins
FT                   responsible for resistance to glycopeptide antibiotics such
FT                   as vancomycin. The mechanism of glyopeptide antibiotic
FT                   resistance involves the production of D-alanine-D-lactate
FT                   (VanA and VanB families) or D-alanine-D-serine (VanC). The
FT                   seed alignment contains only chromosomally encoded
