FT                   /note="Domain:cl19503:T2SSF Type II secretion system
FT                   (T2SS), protein F. The original family covered both the
FT                   regions found by the current model. The splitting of the
FT                   family has allowed the related FlaJ_arch (archaeal FlaJ
FT                   family) to be merged with it. Proteins with this domain in
FT                   form a platform for the machiney of the Type II secretion
FT                   system, as well as the Type 4 pili and the archaeal
FT                   flagella. This domain seems to show some similarity to
FT                   PF00664 but this may just be due to similarities in the TM
FT                   helices (personal obs: C Yeats). [Superfamily,
FT                   Aligned:5-293, Eval:5.8e-48, score:159.8]"
