FT                   vesicular amino butyric acid (GABA) transporter, (VGAT).
FT                   UNC-47 is predicted to have 10 transmembrane domains. MTR
FT                   is a N system amino acid transporter system protein
FT                   involved in methyltryptophan resistance. Other members of
FT                   this family include proline transporters and amino acid
FT                   permeases. [Superfamily, Aligned:12-393, Eval:5.6e-39,
FT                   score:142.8]"
