FT                   domain at the N-terminus of proteins arginine
FT                   methyltransferase 10 proteins. Protein arginine
FT                   methyltransferases catalyze the transfer of methyl groups
FT                   from S-adenosylmethionine - SAM - to arginine residues in
FT                   target proteins thereby releasing S-adensoylhomocystein -
FT                   SAH - as a product. Post-translational modification of
FT                   arginine plays important roles in the eukaryotic cell such
FT                   as signal transduction.This SAM-binding domain forms part
