FT                   /note="Domain:cl21594:Gate Nucleoside recognition. Members
FT                   of this protein family are found exclusively in Firmicutes
FT                   (low-GC Gram-positive bacterial) and are known from studies
FT                   in Bacillus subtilis to be part of the sigma-E regulon.
FT                   Mutation leads to a sporulation defect, confirming that
FT                   members of this protein family, YlbJ, are sporulation
FT                   proteins. This protein appears to be universal among
FT                   endospore-forming bacteria, but is encoded by a pair ORFs
FT                   distant from eash other in Symbiobacterium thermophilum
