FT                   Synechocystis sp., and Aquifex aeolicus are slightly
FT                   shorter, more closely related to each other than to other
FT                   hisS proteins, and actually serve as regulatory subunits
FT                   for an enzyme of histidine biosynthesis. They were excluded
FT                   from the seed alignment and score much lower than do single
FT                   copy histidyl-tRNA synthetases of other genomes not
