FT                   /note="Domain:cl10022:ABM Antibiotic biosynthesis
FT                   monooxygenase. The function of this family is unknown, but
FT                   it is upregulated in response to salt stress in Populus
FT                   balsamifera. It is also found at the C-terminus of an
FT                   fructose 1,6-bisphosphate aldolase from Hydrogenophilus
FT                   thermoluteolus. Arthrobacter nicotinovorans ORF106 is found
FT                   in the pA01 plasmid, which encodes genes for molybdopterin
FT                   uptake and degradation of plant alkaloid nicotine. The
FT                   structure of one has been solved and the domain forms an
FT                   a/b barrel dimer. Although there is a clear duplication
FT                   within the domain it is not obviously detectable in the
FT                   sequence. [Superfamily, Aligned:1-181, Eval:7.2e-62,
FT                   score:187.7]"
