FT                   secretory pathway ATPase [Cell motility, Intracellular
FT                   trafficking, secretion, and vesicular transport]. Members
FT                   of this protein family are the FliI protein of bacterial
FT                   flagellum systems. This protein acts to drive protein
FT                   export for flagellar biosynthesis. The most closely related
