FT                   /note="Domain:cl07980:FHIPEP FHIPEP family. Members of this
FT                   family are closely homologous to the flagellar biosynthesis
FT                   protein FlhA (TIGR01398) and should all participate in type
FT                   III secretion systems. Examples include InvA (Salmonella
FT                   enterica), LcrD (Yersinia enterocolitica), HrcV
FT                   (Xanthomonas), etc. Type III secretion systems resemble
FT                   flagellar biogenesis systems, and may share the property of
FT                   translocating special classes of peptides through the
FT                   membrane. [Protein fate, Protein and peptide secretion and
