FT                   /note="Domain:cl27169:ZipA N/A. This family represents the
FT                   ZipA C-terminal domain. ZipA is involved in septum
FT                   formation in bacterial cell division. Its C-terminal domain
FT                   binds FtsZ, a major component of the bacterial septal ring.
FT                   The structure of this domain is an alpha-beta fold with
FT                   three alpha helices and a beta sheet of six antiparallel
