FT                   /note="Domain:cl26857:PyrG CTP synthase (UTP-ammonia lyase)
FT                   [Nucleotide transport and metabolism]. CTP synthase is
FT                   involved in pyrimidine ribonucleotide/ribonucleoside
FT                   metabolism. The enzyme catalyzes the reaction L-glutamine +
FT                   H2O + UTP + ATP = CTP + phosphate + ADP + L-glutamate. The
FT                   enzyme exists as a dimer of identical chains that
FT                   aggregates as a tetramer. This gene has been found circa
