FT                   found in the PQQ biosynthesis region and is thought to act
FT                   as a protease on PqqA (TIGR02107), a probable peptide
FT                   precursor of the coenzyme. PQQ is required for some glucose
FT                   dehydrogenases and alcohol dehydrogenases. [Biosynthesis of
FT                   cofactors, prosthetic groups, and carriers, Other]
