FT                   /note="Domain:cl28602:ZnuA ABC-type Zn uptake system
FT                   ZnuABC, Zn-binding component ZnuA [Inorganic ion transport
FT                   and metabolism]. Members of this protein family are ABC
FT                   transporter permease subunits as identified by pfam00950,
FT                   but additionally contain the Actinobacterial insert domain
FT                   described by TIGR03769. Some homologs (lacking the insert)
FT                   have been described as transporters of manganese or of
FT                   chelated iron. Members of this family typically are found
FT                   along with an ATP-binding cassette protein, a permease, and
FT                   an LPXTG-anchored protein with two or three copies of the
FT                   TIGR03769 insert that occurs just once in this protein
FT                   family. [Transport and binding proteins, Unknown substrate]
FT                   [Superfamily, Aligned:5-279, Eval:8.7e-21, score:87.4]"
