FT                   /note="Domain:cl01370:DotU Type VI secretion system protein
FT                   DotU. At least two families of proteins, often encoded by
FT                   adjacent genes, show sequence similarity due to homology
FT                   between type IV secretion systems and type VI secretion
FT                   systems. One is the IcmF family (TIGR03348). The other is
FT                   the family described by this model. Members include DotU
FT                   from the Legionella pneumophila type IV secretion system.
FT                   Many of the members of this protein family from type VI
FT                   secretion systems have an additional C-terminal domain with
FT                   OmpA/MotB homology. [Protein fate, Protein and peptide
FT                   secretion and trafficking, Cellular processes,
