FT                   /note="Domain:cl28181:AAA ATPases associated with a variety
FT                   of cellular activities. Members of this family are
FT                   ATP-binding cassette (ABC) proteins by homology, but belong
FT                   to energy coupling factor (ECF) transport systems. The
FT                   architecture in general is two ATPase subunits (or a
FT                   double-length fusion protein), a T component, and a
FT                   substrate capture (S) component that is highly variable,
FT                   and may be interchangeable in genomes with only one T
FT                   component. This model identifies many but not examples of
FT                   the downstream member of the pair of ECF ATPases in
